const body = `<h1>Unit 6 — Jumping</h1>

<p class="lesson-lead">Platforming, from the inside: a physics flick (<code>gravityScale</code> &amp; <code>jumpForce</code>), Ground tag collision counting (<code>jumpsRemaining</code>), waypoint moving platforms (<code>Platform.cs</code>), and moving double jumps onto <code>StatManager</code>.</p>

<h2>Lessons</h2>
<table>
    <tr><th>ID</th><th>Title</th><th>What you build / learn</th></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/6.1.html">6.1</a></td><td>Gravity &amp; Jump: The First Flick</td><td>scene-switched <code>gravityScale</code>, <code>isPlatformer</code>, and <code>AddForceY()</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/6.2.html">6.2</a></td><td>Ground Collision &amp; Jump Count</td><td><code>jumpsRemaining</code>, <code>OnCollisionEnter2D()</code>, and <code>CompareTag("Ground")</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/6.3.html">6.3</a></td><td>Moving Platforms &amp; Jump Tuning</td><td><code>Platform.cs</code> (<code>wayPoints</code>, <code>isOn</code>, <code>SetParent()</code>) and heavy jump tuning</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/6.4.html">6.4</a></td><td>Double Jump: Moving Jumps to StatManager</td><td>moving <code>jumpsRemaining</code> and <code>maxJumps</code> onto <code>StatManager</code> + boss prep studio</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/6.5.html">6.5</a></td><td>Platforming Studio: The Gauntlet</td><td>five sections, one room, blind testers</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Concepts this unit owns</h2>
<p><strong>Physics + persistent budgets</strong>: separating horizontal speed from gravity fall speed, tracking jump budgets in an integer counter instead of a bool, parenting on moving platforms, and deciding which stats live permanently on <code>StatManager</code>. CED: AAP-1, AAP-2, CRD-2.</p>

